          },
          {
            "label": "Long-running character",
            "value": "Large and dangerous attempts to enter Ceuta from Morocco are not new: UNHCR documented increased mass attempts at the Ceuta and Melilla fences in 2005, illustrating the recurring nature of pressure at these border crossings.",
